   "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_4": "All right. You can look now.",
   "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_5": "You open your eyes. Both her hands are now wearing hand puppets, one a knight with a majestic aura, the other a rather wicked-looking sea monster.",
   "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_6": "Today's story is... the great battle between a righteous knight and the wicked sea monster!",
-  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_7": "The puppets come alive under her hands. Knight and monster trade blow after blow, an even match, neither giving ground.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_7": "The puppets come alive under her hands. The knight and the monster trade blow after blow, an even match, neither giving ground.",
   "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_8": "As the sea monster falls at last beneath the knight's blade, Cartethyia pushes both hands forward and offers the puppets to you.",
   "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_9": "I made them myself back when I was at the orphanage. They got me through plenty of hard nights. From now on, let them keep you company during your journeys in my place.",
   "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_1": "You walk into the Student Council room and find Changli alone in the spacious office.",
@@ -37489,7 +37489,7 @@
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_111": "Even a reasonably small orchestra needs enough players in strings, woodwinds, brass, and percussion.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_112": "That means around twenty people at the bare minimum.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_113": "The other problem being: the club doesn't have enough instruments, either.",
-  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_114": "Even if every member is assigned a part, some sections still can't perform together without their intended instrumentation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_114": "Even if every member is assigned a part, some sections still can't perform together with their intended instrumentation.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_115": "A few spare instruments sit in storage, but hardly any are ready for immediate use.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_116": "Not to mention some of the instruments the club is already using haven't been maintained in a long time, and they're not in great shape.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_117": "Consumables and cleaning supplies need restocking too: strings, bow hair, reeds, rosin, and the like.",
@@ -37497,7 +37497,7 @@
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_119": "The other problem being: the club barely has enough members to cover a few sections.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_12": "By believing, trying, and persevering, time after time, a future that was once only possible can become reality.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_120": "When the full ensemble finally comes together, there will probably be many empty chairs.",
-  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_121": "Even if every member is assigned a part, some sections still can't perform together without their intended instrumentation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_121": "Even if every member is assigned a part, some sections still can't perform together with their intended instrumentation.",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_122": "(Besides recruiting and training, I'll need to find a way to buy or borrow more instruments...)",
   "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_123": "(Posters and flyers can only do so much. Why not let people listen to our performance, as we did at the start of the school year?)",
